Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The emblem on his wrist belonged\Nto the Murder Guild from SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God knows how many players\Nthey killed in their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not the only\Nones guilty of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the tip we got's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be near Laughing Coffin's base\Nbut before we charge in, let's keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:05:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing in mind those guys are red players\Nonce the battle starts they're not gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think twice about killing any one of us\Nso don't you hesitate you do and you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead we've got two things going for us\Nthough we outnumber them and we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higher skill levels so who knows maybe\Nthey'll surrender peacefully hell a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can dream, can't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must delete our\Nplans, these bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They caught us off guard,\Nbut we regrouped in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're outnumbered. Surrender now or else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on drop your sword do it you can't\Ntake another hit drop the sword now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned into a blood-soaked\Nnightmare after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won the battle, but by the time\Nit was over, we'd lost 10 of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Laughing Coffin, 20 of them\Nrefused to surrender and were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of that 20, two lives\Nwere claimed by my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy if he's one of the survivors from\NLaughing Coffin then he must have talked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me at some point after that battle or
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:08:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe he's one of the two people I killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name I share with\Nthis weapon. Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His voice was the same as Death Gun's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he be Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you're about to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess your first match was\Ntougher than you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got back pretty early, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby for a noob.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, if you're like this after one match,\Nyou'll never make it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better man up, guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we got things to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
