Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.64,0:10:07.14,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\blur0.6\pos(1306.5,111)}— BoB Preliminaries 4th Round{\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp}・{\fn}Battlefield —
