Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That player got a death wish or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he keeps\Nwinning fighting like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His next match is in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get out there and rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.90,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\blur0.6\pos(1308,969)}— BoB Preliminaries 5th Round{\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp}・{\fn}Battlefield —
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.90,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\blur1.8\1a&H4C&\c&H000000&\pos(1312.5,973.5)}— BoB Preliminaries 5th Round{\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp}・{\fn}Battlefield —
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stinger's my target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His main weapon is an\NFN Scar Carbine Rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a sniper, if I let him\Nget too close, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on this map, if he wants to close in\Non me, he's gonna have to go through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where I'll take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wanted me to waste my first shot\Nto buy him time so he could advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for him, because I know\Nthe path my first bullet took.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My second one will be right on target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have got out of the car, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you did, you might have seen the\Nbullet lying in time to dodge it.
