Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna try and close in on\Nme using the shadows for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only chance is nailing him with the first\Nshot before he figures out my location.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't even know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I want to beat him so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because he reminds me of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he think he can dodge\Nmy bullet at this range?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he even want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, don't, don't screw with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh… Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight me come on fight or maybe\Nyou think i'm not worth the effort
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you got it all wrong all i\Nwant is to compete in the final
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no reason to fight\Nanymore then go on and shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself and get it over with or\Nwould that be a waste of ammo or
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you wanted me to shoot\Nyou because you thought it would
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the score between us to\Nyou it's just a game, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid match that's all it is\Nto you is that is a game well
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because you feel that way\Ndoesn't mean i do but if we do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meet in the final bracket of\Nthe prelims i'll be playing to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:16:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,win oh i get it all right if we\Nboth make it No holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only one match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, that's why we\Nhave to give it all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's how we live, how we keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone should have known that, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, give me a chance\Nto make it right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me give you the fight I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, if you're messing with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got any bullets left\Non you, or are you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's have a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll stand 10 meters apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You with your rifle, and me with my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll toss this bullet up, and\Nwhen it hits the ground, we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're 10 meters away from each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it won't give you enough time to\Nsee the bullet line and react.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with my Hecate,\NI'll definitely hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.95,0:17:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that range, I can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't know for sure till you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he acting so confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he have a plan or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I'm ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's how you want it, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew where I was aiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was going for your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew because I could see your\Neye through the lens of your scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how he predicted my bullet's path?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of power is\Nway beyond any VR game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're so strong you can do that,\Nwhy'd you look so afraid before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it is is a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technique isn't enough to cut a\Nbullet from my Hecate in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I both know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes strength, and all I\Nwant to know is how to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:19:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I'm here to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you shoot a player\Nin here if you knew
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the real world that\Nplayer would die from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if you had to kill that player?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you didn't, you or\Nsomeone you love would die instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had that power, could\Nyou still pull that trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About what happened to me that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe something like\Nthat happened to him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go through that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm not as strong as you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the names of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.81,0:20:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, three people I killed\Nin that other game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to live with it every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And every day I keep hoping I'll forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess this means I\Nwon the duel, doesn't it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you mind surrendering then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a big fan of\Nslashing at girls. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'm not gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make sure you survive\Nuntil you see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Resign!
