Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k24\fad(200,200)}Hi{\k21}to{\k26}tsu {\k46}mo {\k24}i{\k41}ra{\k44}nai {\k237}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k98\fad(200,200)}Mo{\k46}tto {\k44}tsu{\k23}yo{\k88}ku {\k29}sou {\k40}tsu{\k22}yo{\k91}ku {\k21}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k45}i {\k44}to {\k45}ne{\k44}ga{\k44}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Like a lonely star racing across the darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,200)}Ku{\k21}ra{\k21}ya{\k48}mi {\k22}wo {\k43}ka{\k48}ke{\k131}ru {\k26}ko{\k20}do{\k23}ku {\k43}na {\k21}ho{\k48}shi {\k20}no {\k25}you {\k59}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sunk so deep inside my heart, I'm so weak and fragile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k53\fad(200,200)}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
